This project adapts the structure, field mapping, and lifecycle behavior of
mistralai-search-toolkit-plugins-qdrant 0.1.5, by the Qdrant Team:
https://github.com/qdrant-labs/mistral-qdrant-plugin
Reference commit: 06f12c7f0d4f74e6e29fc3d0226e4f08bb9e00ae (Apache-2.0).

The adapter has been modified for Meilisearch: native hybrid and keyword search,
facets, provider-managed embeddings, and Meilisearch document/task operations.
This is an independent integration, not an official Mistral or Meilisearch package.
